    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Former Sabbat Kindred</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Former Sabbat Kindred (@UUID[JournalEntry.AnZpyM4onyACPwiC.JournalEntryPage.18vJtyOOVZe1Uk41]{GAN-09 · The Larchmont Survivor}). Nobody knows his name. He&#39;s spent twelve years in the Tacoma storm drains, feeding carefully. Old, patient, deformed by the 2014 fire. He visits the Larchmont cistern barefoot.</p>\n<p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Obfuscate 3, Protean 2 (Feral Weapons), Fortitude 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Tactics:</strong> he never fights in the open. He flees toward the water and waits.</p>",
